{"articleNo":"504878","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=504878&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2025년 상반기 제주특별자치도 학자금 대출이자 지원 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.01.15","hit":"11995","attachments":[{"name":"2025년 상반기 학자금 대출이자 지원 사업 홍보(홈페이지 게시).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=504878&attachNo=140120"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">제주특별자치도에서 2025년 상반기 제주 출신 청년들의 학비부담 경감을 위해 한국장학재단을 통해 대출받은 학자금에 대한 이자를 지원하고자 하오니 학생들의 많은 관심 바랍니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청기간: 2025.1.13.(월) 10:00 ~ 4.11.(금) 18:00</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청방법:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">정부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">24(</span><a href=\"http://www.gov.xn--kr)-k94n91q/\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">www.gov.kr)</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">에서</span></u></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">제주 학자금 대출이자 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">” </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">검색 후 온라인 신청</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">신청대상:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">20</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -1.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">24.7.13</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -1.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">일 이전부터 도내 주민등록이 되어 있는 자 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">또는 도내 고등학교를 졸업한 자 중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">국내 대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">휴학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">졸업 후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">10</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">년 이내 미취업자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(2025.1.13.</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">일 기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">지원내용:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.8pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2010</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.8pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">년부터 한국장학재단을 통해 받은 학자금에 대한 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.8pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2024</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.8pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.8pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">7</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.8pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">∼</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -15.8pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">12</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.8pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">월 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.8pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">발생이자 전액</span></p><p><span style=\"text-indent: -15.8pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">문의전화: 제주도청 청년정책담당관 ☎</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -68.3pt;\">064)710-3894</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"7050\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"tes